|---------------------|-------------------------|
| `/login`            | Sign in                 |
| `/register`         | Create account          |
| `/forgot-password`  | Request reset link      |
| `/reset-password`   | Set new password        |
| `/verify-email`     | Email verification      |

### Onboarding
